n  writer  doug munch and celebrated incredible  hulk artist herb trimpy created an  entirely new universe  for the radioactive monster to trample  complete with a fresh  terrifying rogues gallery some of  godzilla's comic book opponents came  from marvel's existing bullpen  godzilla battled the avengers the  fantastic four spider-man and even devil  dinosaur and  moonboy over the course of the series  others however were created specifically  for the title like yetregard a  sasquatch-styled behemoth freed from an  icy tomb in canada by atomic testing  which also boosted his height to over  100 feet  godzilla battled the monster over the  course of two issues before it was  defeated in a climactic battle  deep inside the grand canyon but that  wasn't the end of yet regards marvel run  the hairy creature would tangle with  both the avengers and the west coast  avengers before being transported to the  super secret  maximum security prison known as the  vault where he apparently  sits biding his time to this day  the 2007 video game godzilla unleashed  offered players their choice of more  than 20 of doho's monsters to take  control of for the sake of well  unleashing chaos the developers also  padded out the game's roster of classic  creatures with two new entities  designed specifically for the game  itself one of them a bipedal mutant  monster called obsidius that was created  from magma and minerals was included  after being selected from a group of  four possible kaiju by readers of ign in  a 2007 poll  the faceless brute of a creature was  given a wide array of abilities  including a lava beam which is  fitting given his original name of  magmoth in the playstation 2 version of  the game obsidius was also granted the  ability to absorb some of the life force  from his opponents  obsidius was the only new monster to  appear in both the wii  and playstation 2 versions of godzilla  unleashed which also remains his sole  showcase to date  and that's a shame because 